# Complete residual ledger for the natural 248-byte, exact-topology body.
# One scalar web holds each descriptor value in a0 instead of the target's v0;
# the call argument copies at +0x68/+0x98 are therefore absent.  These field
# changes cover that entire web and its two argument materializations.
